5,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... hello. I'm not really sure what to say first... but I hope we can all get along and find the werewolf together. Please be kind to me.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Let's keep this efficient. Since we have no information yet, I'll be observing everyone's reactions. @Daisuke, there's no need to be so nervous; just stay focused on the logic of the game.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Efficiency is fine, Shion, but let's not be too cold. I'm perfectly confident we'll sniff out the wolf soon enough. For now, I'll just enjoy watching how you all scramble for clues.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,"It's nice to meet everyone. Let's try to keep things peaceful and supportive while we work together. @Daisuke, don't worry too much; we're all in this together. I'm looking forward to seeing how we can help each other.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,George,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. Let us maintain our composure and proceed with patience. I shall observe the conversation carefully to see who among us is being truthful.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"Thank you, Midori-san... that makes me feel a bit better. I'll try my best to help, even if I'm not very good at this. I... I'll just listen to what everyone has to say for now.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Listening is fine, but passivity can be a liability. @Shunichi, your confidence is interesting, but it borders on arrogance. Are you trying to project strength to hide something, or are you truly that sure of yourself?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, you're quite the analyst, aren't you? It's not arrogance; it's simply a fact that I'm comfortable in my own skin. If you're looking for a ""tell,"" you'll find nothing but confidence here.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, @Shunichi, please let's not start arguing so early. It's important that we maintain a good atmosphere if we want to trust each other. Let's try to be a bit more gentle with our words.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,George,,Midori is right. Friction this early serves no purpose. Let us focus on the facts as they emerge rather than attacking each other's personalities. I will continue to watch and listen.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree with George-san and Midori-san. I don't like it when people fight... but I'll try to pay attention to what everyone is saying, like Shion-kun suggested. I'm sorry I'm so quiet.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""George"",""Midori"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, apologies if I seemed harsh, but clarity is more valuable than comfort in this game. @George, you're very passive. Are you waiting for a specific pattern to emerge, or are you simply avoiding commitment?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, you're practically itching for a fight. It's almost amusing. George is just being the adult in the room, unlike some of us who think being ""logical"" means being a nuisance. I'm quite content with the pace.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, thank you for looking out for George-san. @Shion, I appreciate your desire for clarity, but let's remember that we are all humans here. Maybe we can find a balance between logic and kindness?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""George"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,George,,"@Shion, I am not avoiding commitment, but rather ensuring that my conclusions are based on evidence. Rushing to judgment is a mistake. I believe a balanced approach, as Midori suggests, is the most reliable path forward.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think everyone's points are important. I'll do my best to stay focused and help the village. I hope tomorrow we can find some real clues... Good luck to everyone tonight.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Shion,,"I've noted everyone's stances. Midori and George are prioritizing harmony, while Shunichi is playing the role of the confident observer. I'll be watching for any contradictions tomorrow.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I've enjoyed this little dance. Shion, your ""notes"" are cute, but don't let your desire for a pattern blind you to the obvious. I'm looking forward to seeing who breaks first tomorrow.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Midori,,I hope we can all sleep peacefully tonight. Let's trust each other and work together tomorrow to find the truth. I'll be rooting for all of us.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,George,,I agree. Let us hope for a productive day tomorrow. I shall keep a keen eye on the developments and trust that the truth will reveal itself in due time. Good night to you all.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
