36,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... good morning. I hope everyone is okay. I'm still a bit nervous, but... does anyone have any information? I'm not sure if the Seer found anything...","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@George, as the most composed among us, I suspect you might be the Seer. If you have a result, now is the time to share it. Or perhaps the Seer is playing a more cautious game?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, always so eager to push others into a corner. Why are you so obsessed with forcing George to reveal himself? It seems more like you're trying to control the flow of information than actually seeking the truth.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, please don't pressure George-san so much. If the Seer wants to share their findings, they will do so when they feel it's safest for the village. Let's be patient and listen.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,George,,"@Shion, your intuition is sharp, but your haste is risky. I am indeed the Seer. I divined Shunichi last night, and the result was clear: he is the Werewolf. We must act decisively.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"Wait... really? Shunichi-san is the werewolf? I... I can't believe it. George-san, are you absolutely sure? I don't want us to make a mistake and execute someone innocent... but I trust your judgment.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@George, a direct reveal this early is a bold move. If you're telling the truth, the game is practically over. @Shunichi, the Seer has named you. Do you have a logical defense, or will you continue with the sarcasm?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@George, what a clumsy lie. To claim the Werewolf is so obvious on day one? You're either a very bad liar or a desperate wolf trying to frame me. I'm human, and your ""divination"" is a complete fabrication.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@George-san, @Shunichi-san, please, let's stay calm. This is a very shocking revelation. @Shunichi-san, if you are human, how can you explain George-san's certainty? We need to find a way to resolve this without panic.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,George,,"@Shunichi, your denial is expected, but it does not change the fact. I have no reason to lie and risk my life for a falsehood. The evidence is absolute; you are the wolf.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I don't know who to believe. George-san seems so sure, but Shunichi-san is so confident too. If we execute the wrong person, it'll be terrible... but if we leave the wolf, someone else will be attacked tonight.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Midori, your desire for peace is hindering us. We have a direct conflict: George claims to be the Seer and identifies Shunichi as the wolf. Shunichi denies it. Logically, one of them is lying. @Shunichi, your confidence is now a liability.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, you're so enamored with your ""logic"" that you're ignoring the obvious play here. George is attempting a fast-track win by claiming the Seer role. It's a classic bluff. If I were the wolf, would I be this calm? I'm a human being framed.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi-san, your calmness is usually reassuring, but George-san's conviction is very strong. @Shion, please don't be so harsh with me. I just want us to be absolutely sure before we make a decision that can't be undone.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""George"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,George,,"@Midori, I appreciate your caution, but hesitation only benefits the wolf. @Shunichi, calmness is not proof of innocence; it is often the mask of a predator. I have seen the truth, and I stand by it.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think we have to trust George-san. He's been so calm and reliable... and he's risking everything by coming forward. I'm scared, but I'll vote for Shunichi-san. I'm sorry, Shunichi-san... but we have to protect the village.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Shion,,"@George's reveal is too direct to be a bluff; a wolf would typically wait to see the wind's direction. @Shunichi, your confidence has finally hit a wall. Logically, the most efficient path to victory is executing you. I'll vote for Shunichi.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, @Shion, you're both falling for the oldest trick in the book. George is simply playing on your trust and ""logic."" I'm a human being framed by a wolf. You'll regret this tomorrow when the wolf still walks among you.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shion"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi-san, I really don't want to believe this, but George-san's conviction is so strong. I'll trust the Seer's vision for the sake of everyone's safety. I'm so sorry, but I will vote for Shunichi-san.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,George,,"The decision is made. While I regret that it has come to this, the truth is undeniable. For the safety of the village, we must execute Shunichi. I cast my vote for Shunichi.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
